---
// Static site footer: project blurb, contribute CTAs, and the
// "Powered by CSFloat" bottom row.
---
<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
        <div class="footer-columns">
            <div>
                <h3>What is reverse.watch?</h3>
                <p>
                    A shared, open record of trade reversals across the Steam ecosystem.
                    When a marketplace, trading tool, or community platform reverses a
                    trade due to fraud, scams, or policy violations, that report can be
                    contributed to the database. Anyone can then look up a Steam ID and
                    check whether it has appeared in past reversals, regardless of which
                    platform originally flagged it.
                </p>
                <p>
                    For faster access while browsing, reverse.watch is also integrated into
                    the CSFloat extension.
                </p>
                <div class="footer-cta-row">
                    <a class="footer-cta" href="https://csfloat.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">extension</span>
                        Get the extension
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Want to contribute?</h3>
                <p>
                    If you run a marketplace, trading tool, or community site and want to
                    participate by contributing reversal reports, reach out at
                    <a href="mailto:join@reverse.watch">join@reverse.watch</a>.
                </p>
                <p>
                    The project is also open source, so if you'd like to help with issues
                    or contribute code, you can find the repository on
                    <a href="https://github.com/csfloat/reverse-watch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
                </p>
                <div class="footer-cta-row">
                    <a class="footer-cta" href="mailto:join@reverse.watch">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">mail</span>
                        Email us
                    </a>
                    <a class="footer-cta" href="https://github.com/csfloat/reverse-watch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">code</span>
                        Join on GitHub
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <div class="footer-powered">
                <span>Powered by</span>
                <a href="https://csfloat.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="CSFloat">
                    <img class="csfloat-logo" src="/static/csfloat-logo.png" alt="CSFloat" width="116" height="36">
                </a>
            </div>
            <p class="footer-disclaimer">Reverse.Watch 2026. Not affiliated with Valve Corp.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
